OL,3,ATrump vows tougher economic measures on
OL,4,AIran and supporting countries
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after a 60-day ceasefire
OL,7,Fformally expired on Monday, with no
OL,8,Fsign of a diplomatic or military
OL,9,Foff-ramp to the conflict that the US
OL,10,Fand Israel began at the end of
OL,11,FFebruary.
OL,13,FTrump's latest move appears to extend
OL,14,Fthe US campaign of economic pressure,
OL,15,Flaunched in April with the sanctioning
OL,16,Fof foreign banks or firms that do
OL,17,Fbusiness with Tehran.
